itches and excavating new tidal channels, the project is set to enhance both habitat quality and water conditions for the local wildlife. The initiative seeks to revive historical floodplain areas, allowing natural tidal movements to resume.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/oregons-siletz-bay-is-restoring-37-acres-of-tidal-wetland-this-summer-digging-new-channels-where-more-than-a-century-of-diking-turned-marsh-into-pasture/articleshow/133183444.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/oregons-siletz-bay-is-restoring-37-acres-of-tidal-wetland-this-summer-digging-new-channels-where-more-than-a-century-of-diking-turned-marsh-into-pasture/articleshow/133183444.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T18:28:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133183858,imgsize-1083535.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Zhu Rongji, former premier who changed China's economic fate passes away at 97]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133183305.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/zhu-rongji-former-premier-who-changed-chinas-economic-fate-passes-away-at-97/articleshow/133183305.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/zhu-rongji-former-premier-who-changed-chinas-economic-fate-passes-away-at-97/articleshow/133183305.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T18:19:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133183341,imgsize-104772.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[One-third of global farmland accounts for about two-thirds of agriculture-linked biodiversity]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133182304.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A global study reveals one-third of farmland causes two-thirds of farming's environmental damage. Beef and dairy production significantly contribute to biodiversity loss and carbon storage decline. High-impact regions in South America and Asia face concentrated environmental degradation. International trade shifts these environmental impacts between exporting and importing nations. Targeted restoration of impacted land offers substantial climate and nature protection benefits.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/one-third-of-global-farmland-accounts-for-about-two-thirds-of-agriculture-linked-biodiversity-and-natural-carbon-storage-loss-a-new-study-finds/articleshow/133182304.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/one-third-of-global-farmland-accounts-for-about-two-thirds-of-agriculture-linked-biodiversity-and-natural-carbon-storage-loss-a-new-study-finds/articleshow/133182304.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T18:17:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133183071,imgsize-1048952.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['This is just the beginning': Trump official on 175,000 visa revocations; 'All we ask is a couple of things...']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133182711.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-is-just-the-beginning-trump-official-on-175000-visa-revocations-all-we-ask-is-a-couple-of-things-/articleshow/133182711.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/this-is-just-th